Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/dsa.c
Line: 273
Function: dsa_main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: OSSL_ENCODER_CTX_new_for_pkey(pkey, ...) may return NULL (e.g., on allocation failure). The return value 'ectx' is used immediately in OSSL_ENCODER_CTX_get_num_encoders(ectx) without a NULL check, leading to a potential NULL pointer dereference.

